            <!-- ORDERS -->
            <h2 id="orders">Orders & Placing an Order</h2>
            <dl class="faq-list">
              <dt>How do I place an order?</dt>
              <dd>Choose your items, add them to the cart, then proceed to checkout. Enter shipping and payment details, review your order, and confirm. You will receive an order confirmation email with an order number and estimated delivery window.</dd>

              <dt>Can I change or cancel my order after placing it?</dt>
              <dd>Changes are only possible while the order is in 'Processing' status. Contact support immediately with your order number — the faster you contact us, the higher the chance we can modify or cancel before dispatch.</dd>

              <dt>What if an item is out of stock after I purchase?</dt>
              <dd>If an item becomes unavailable we will notify you and offer an alternative, backorder option, or full refund — your choice. Refunds for unavailable items are processed promptly to your original payment method.</dd>
            </dl>

            <!-- TRACKING -->
            <h2 id="tracking">Order Tracking</h2>
            <dl class="faq-list">
              <dt>How can I track my shipment?</dt>
              <dd>When your order ships you will receive an email with a tracking number and courier link. You can also go to <a href="/customer/track-order">Track Order</a> and enter your order number and email to view current status and location updates (courier updates may be delayed by a few hours).</dd>

              <dt>Why is my tracking status not updating?</dt>
              <dd>Courier systems sometimes take time to push updates. If there's no update after 24 hours or you see inconsistent statuses, contact support with your order number and tracking number — we'll escalate with the courier.</dd>

              <dt>Can I get a real-time map of my delivery?</dt>
              <dd>Map tracking is available for selected couriers and only when the courier provides that feature. If map tracking isn't available, the tracking page shows the latest status and expected delivery window.</dd>
            </dl>

            <!-- SHIPPING -->
            <h2 id="shipping">Shipping & Delivery</h2>
            <dl class="faq-list">
              <dt>What are the delivery options and costs?</dt>
              <dd>Available delivery options (standard, express) and fees are shown at checkout and vary by destination. Estimated delivery times are provided per shipping option; these are estimates and may change due to carrier logistics or customs clearance.</dd>

              <dt>Do you ship internationally and who pays customs/duties?</dt>
              <dd>We ship to many international destinations. Import taxes, duties, and customs clearance fees are the responsibility of the recipient unless explicitly stated at checkout. For business shipments, we can provide DDP (Delivered Duty Paid) on request — contact our B2B team.</dd>

              <dt>What happens if a delivery attempt fails?</dt>
              <dd>If a carrier cannot deliver, they will usually re-attempt delivery or leave collection instructions. If delivery fails repeatedly, contact support with your order number so we can assist with re-scheduling or local depot pickup options.</dd>
            </dl>

            <!-- RETURNS -->
            <h2 id="returns">Returns & Refunds</h2>
            <dl class="faq-list">
              <dt>How do I start a return?</dt>
              <dd>Open <strong>My Orders</strong>, select the relevant order, and click 'Request Return' for eligible items. Follow the steps to generate a return label (if provided) and ship the item within the return window. For bulky or heavy items, follow the special instructions on the Returns Policy page.</dd>

              <dt>Which items are not eligible for return?</dt>
              <dd>Certain items are excluded: perishable goods, personalised/customised items, and opened hygiene products unless faulty. The Returns Policy page lists precise exclusions and conditions by product category.</dd>

              <dt>When will I receive my refund?</dt>
              <dd>We issue refunds after we receive and inspect the return. Refunds are typically processed within 5–10 business days to the original payment method. Timing may vary by bank or payment provider.</dd>
            </dl>

            <!-- PAYMENTS -->
            <h2 id="payments">Payments & Billing</h2>
            <dl class="faq-list">
              <dt>What payment methods are accepted?</dt>
              <dd>We accept major credit/debit cards and trusted online payment methods. Payment information is processed by PCI-compliant providers — we do not store full card numbers on our servers.</dd>

              <dt>I was charged multiple times — how do I resolve it?</dt>
              <dd>Supply your order number and transaction IDs to support. We will investigate with the payment processor and arrange a refund for any duplicate charges as quickly as possible.</dd>

              <dt>Can I get an invoice for my purchase?</dt>
              <dd>Yes — invoices are available in your account under Order Details. For corporate invoicing, request an invoice at purchase or contact partnerships for account billing options.</dd>
            </dl>

            <!-- ACCOUNT -->
            <h2 id="account">Account & Security</h2>
            <dl class="faq-list">
              <dt>I forgot my password — what do I do?</dt>
              <dd>Use the 'Forgot password' link on the sign-in page to receive a secure reset link via your registered email. If you don't receive it, check spam/junk folders or contact support for assistance.</dd>

              <dt>How do I change my registered email or phone?</dt>
              <dd>Update contact details in Account → Profile. Changing your primary email may require verification to ensure account security. For account recovery issues, contact support with proof of identity.</dd>

              <dt>What should I do if my account is compromised?</dt>
              <dd>Immediately change your password and contact support. We will lock the account, review recent activity, and guide you through securing your account and reversing any unauthorized transactions if applicable.</dd>
            </dl>

            <!-- TECHNICAL -->
            <h2 id="technical">Technical Issues</h2>
            <dl class="faq-list">
              <dt>The site shows an error — how can I help the support team diagnose?</dt>
              <dd>Take a screenshot, note the exact steps and the time the error occurred, and include browser name/version and the device used. Submit these via the support form — it makes diagnosis and resolution faster.</dd>

              <dt>Why can't I add items to cart or checkout?</dt>
              <dd>Common causes: cookies disabled, session timeout, or browser extensions interfering. Try clearing cache, using an incognito window, or a different browser. If problem persists, contact technical support with screenshots and product SKUs.</dd>
            </dl>

            <!-- WARRANTY -->
            <h2 id="warranty">Warranty & Repairs</h2>
            <dl class="faq-list">
              <dt>How do I make a warranty claim?</dt>
              <dd>Provide proof of purchase, product SKU, a detailed description, and photos/videos showing the fault. Submit through the support form or warranty portal and our team will guide you on repair, replacement or refund options per the product manufacturer's policy.</dd>

              <dt>Is accidental damage covered?</dt>
              <dd>Standard manufacturer warranties typically exclude accidental damage. Check the product warranty terms for the specific product — extended protection plans may cover accidental damage.</dd>
            </dl>

            <!-- CORPORATE -->
            <h2 id="corporate">Corporate & B2B</h2>
            <dl class="faq-list">
              <dt>How do I place a bulk or corporate order?</dt>
              <dd>Email partnerships@jood.com with company details, VAT/registration number, and estimated volumes. A dedicated account manager will assist with pricing, delivery and invoicing terms.</dd>

              <dt>Can I get credit terms for my company?</dt>
              <dd>Credit facilities are available to qualifying businesses after verification. Contact our B2B team to begin the onboarding and credit application process.</dd>
            </dl>

            <!-- PRIVACY -->
            <h2 id="privacy">Privacy & Data</h2>
            <dl class="faq-list">
              <dt>How is my personal data used?</dt>
              <dd>We process personal data to fulfill orders, provide support, comply with legal obligations, and improve services. For full details, see our <a href="/customer/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/customer/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a>.</dd>

              <dt>How can I request deletion or access to my data?</dt>
              <dd>Submit a data subject request via the Privacy Policy page or email dpo@jood.com. We will process requests in accordance with applicable law and our internal policies.</dd>
            </dl>

            <!-- CONTACT -->
            <h2 id="contact">Contact & Escalation</h2>
            <dl class="faq-list">
              <dt>How do I contact customer support?</dt>
              <dd>Use the <a href="/customer/contact-us">Contact Us</a> page to open a ticket, email <a href="mailto:support@jood.com">support@jood.com</a> or call +971-55-555-5555. Include order number and screenshots where relevant for fastest service.</dd>

              <dt>How do I escalate a complaint?</dt>
              <dd>If unsatisfied, mark the ticket as 'Escalate' or email our Customer Experience Team. We acknowledge escalations within 24 hours and aim to provide a formal written response within 10 business days.</dd>
            </dl>

            <p class="note">If you don't find an answer here, please open a ticket via the Contact page — include order/reference number and supporting material (screenshots, transaction IDs). Our support teams collaborate across operations, logistics and vendors to resolve issues quickly.</p>
